@sprint2 @revision @letters
Feature: [Sprint 2] Revisi Pengajuan oleh Warga dengan Perubahan Biodata
  As a resident whose application was sent back for revision
  I want to correct the purpose, destination and my biodata (or complete it if it was empty)
  So that the RT head can approve the corrected letter

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And the resident "resident@example.test" and the RT head "rt@example.test" are logged in with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"
    And the resident has a new "DOM" application with "digital" signature

  Scenario: Warga memperbaiki keperluan dan biodata lalu mengirim ulang
    Given the RT head has requested a revision with note "Pekerjaan dan tujuan surat salah"
    When the resident resubmits the application with:
      | field       | value                                          |
      | keperluan   | Persyaratan pembukaan rekening di Bank Jatim   |
      | pekerjaan   | Wiraswasta                                     |
      | tujuan      | Bank Jatim Cabang Karang Pilang                |
      | status_kawin | Kawin                                         |
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.status" should be "diajukan"
    And the response field "data.draf_ai" should contain "Wiraswasta"
    And the application status in the database should be "diajukan"

  Scenario: Biodata hasil revisi tersimpan dan catatan revisi dihapus
    Given the RT head has requested a revision with note "Perbarui pekerjaan"
    When the resident resubmits the application with:
      | field     | value                          |
      | keperluan | Persyaratan administrasi bank  |
      | pekerjaan | Guru                           |
    And the resident opens the application detail
    Then the response field "data.pekerjaan" should be "Guru"
    And the response field "data.catatan_revisi" should be null

  Scenario: Biodata tidak valid saat revisi ditolak
    Given the RT head has requested a revision with note "Nomor KK salah"
    When the resident resubmits the application with:
      | field     | value                         |
      | keperluan | Persyaratan administrasi bank |
      | nomor_kk  | 12345                         |
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response field "error" should be "VALIDATION_ERROR"
    And the application status in the database should be "perlu_revisi"

  Scenario: Pengajuan yang tidak diminta revisi tidak bisa dikirim ulang
    When the resident resubmits the application with:
      | field     | value                         |
      | keperluan | Mencoba mengubah tanpa revisi |
    Then the response status code should be 409
    And the response field "error" should be "INVALID_STATUS"
    And the application status in the database should be "diajukan"

  Scenario: Pengajuan hasil revisi dapat langsung disahkan Ketua RT
    Given the RT head has requested a revision with note "Lengkapi keperluan"
    When the resident resubmits the application with:
      | field     | value                                      |
      | keperluan | Persyaratan pembukaan rekening Bank Jatim  |
    And the RT head signs the application with PIN "123456"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.status" should be "selesai"
